NEW POC PLAN
- The IMU will track tilt (roll and pitch).
- No need to level at the start.
- The LiDAR must be aligned to the laser projector, so we are finding tag displacements.
- Using this system we only need 2 points. Print 6 tags of diameter 20cm.
- Tilt combines with LPF'ed stage rotation to give facing angle (or maybe IMU yaw - try both).
- ANY movement turns off the projector. No relocation detection, just a button to be pressed saying "device repositioned".